        "text": "<thinking> The task requires creating a Python file named `stream_microphone.py` that streams microphone audio and yields interim transcripts. To achieve this, I will use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API, which is a concrete external provider for streaming speech recognition. The code will include the necessary imports and authentication to identify the provider. </thinking>\n",
